Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,0)\blur1.5\an8\fs56\3c&H000000&\3a&H5D&}本字幕由喵萌奶茶屋製作  僅供交流試看之用  請勿用於商業用途\N翻譯：飛魚　校對：Nemeton　後期：MIR
Comment: 0,0:00:-03.-05,0:00:-03.-05,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,邁克 總統府和國防部被佔領了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.77,0:00:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,約瑟夫說要炸掉{\fsp8}的{\fsp0}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\fsp0}反應爐發電站也遇襲了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,從目擊情報來看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.99,0:00:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,很可能是那幫忍者幹的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.99,0:00:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.37,0:00:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是約瑟夫要炸掉忍者所在的地方嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我們也在收集情報
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.25,0:00:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你集中精力追捕約瑟夫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.75,0:00:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.17,0:00:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 邁克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.26,0:00:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,完事後一起喝日本酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.84,0:00:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,純米大吟釀 山田錦那款
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.26,0:00:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,可說好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他們起內亂了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.69,0:00:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,傑森 情況如何
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.77,0:00:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,約瑟夫藏{\fsp8}在{\fsp0}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\fsp0}酒店
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.90,0:00:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,和你預想的一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.57,0:00:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有準備好的緊急逃生路線
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:00:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,而那條路線的出口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.91,0:01:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,應該是尼爾大道站
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.95,0:01:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,廢棄車站啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,傑森 再請你做一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.29,0:01:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是你們的目的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,表面上裝作強化國家重要機關
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.97,0:01:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但實則修建據點 以便隨時攻佔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.43,0:01:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你想怎樣 佔領這個國家?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.68,0:01:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我們的目標從來就沒變過
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.23,0:01:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,為世界帶來和平 這才是忍者的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.98,0:01:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,這算是通往和平之路?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,像以往那樣追求勢力均衡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不會有任何改變
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.45,0:01:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,民族 領土 資源 宗教差異誕生出的憤怒和慾望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,人們難以擺脫如此種種
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.17,0:01:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我們將拋棄這一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,成為絕對的抑制力 監視世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,制裁擾亂和平之徒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.97,0:02:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,首先得站到那張桌前布告
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你覺得只要這個國家出手相助
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,就能讓世界為之所動嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.27,0:02:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我們已完全掌{\fsp8}握{\fsp0}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\fsp0}的技術
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.57,0:02:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也包括所有和能源相關的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你們篡奪{\fsp8}了{\fsp0}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\fsp0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我們知道現在的形勢 還有約瑟夫的去向
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.33,0:02:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,這方面我們來處理
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,只是得等到我們解決自身問題之後
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.14,0:02:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我馬上到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.47,0:02:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你那邊如何
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.22,0:02:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,邁克 剛才衛星捕獲到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,在86號公路向北行駛的約瑟夫的車
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.57,0:02:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我就在路上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.65,0:02:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那種地方會有甚麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.36,0:03:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那裡 有放牧型養豬場…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,還{\fsp8}有{\fsp0}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\fsp0}的試驗基地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.99,0:03:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我現在就派附近的搜查官過去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,可別打草驚蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 艾瑪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.75,0:03:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,靠你的駭客系統了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,傑森 還不滾出來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,過會再去 我現在可在操控衛星呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.51,0:03:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他們似乎去試驗基地了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.26,0:03:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.52,0:03:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不過和豬一起上天也算是一段不錯的經歷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.23,0:03:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,下次回到這個國家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.57,0:03:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,將是世界天翻地覆之後了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.87,0:03:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,臭老頭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,痛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.37,0:04:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.71,0:04:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼找到的?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,這工作幹了很多年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,自然見多識廣了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,有緝毒警察曾跟我提過
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.10,0:04:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有人把毒品裝進無法消化的容器裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:04:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,餵給豬試圖走私
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.11,0:05:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你會耍花招 看來猜對了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.61,0:05:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,已經結束了 放棄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.22,0:05:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,傻了吧 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.94,0:05:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,無線電干擾嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.44,0:05:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你們可真是 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.78,0:05:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你或許的確是個天才
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但你能被我這糟老頭逮住
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.75,0:06:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,說明你遲早會走上絕路
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,走上絕路這個詞不會出現在我的人生裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,進步路上出現一點失誤很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,一點失誤? 你要進監獄了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.97,0:06:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你覺得世上有多少人想要我的頭腦?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.98,0:06:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我很快就能出獄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.52,0:06:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不 該說我的失誤在於那時沒殺掉你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,本來你該和那幫忍者一起被炸死的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.49,0:06:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,遊戲裡就得有些麻煩的小角色 否則太無聊了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那時你沒死 看來不是因為你的奧義呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.82,0:07:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是鞠 讓我活了下來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,長達六百年 忍者懷抱著的夙願
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.21,0:07:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,現在即將實現
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你不明白這意味著甚麼嗎 彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.71,0:07:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,這與現在的我無關
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.18,0:07:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我只為斬斷你一手造成的連環悲劇而來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,忍者將被終結
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,忍者不會終結
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,很快一切都將為世人所知
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.32,0:07:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你們已無法繼續活在暗影中了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.15,0:07:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你果然不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.11,0:07:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我是在給予忍者光明
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:07:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,活在暗影中無法成就大義
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,向世界展示無可匹敵的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.37,0:08:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,再靠這力量 守望這個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.13,0:08:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,結果成了這樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,這也並非我所願
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.93,0:08:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,因此
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望這是最後的了結
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.35,0:10:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,彼岸 我只能作為忍者而活
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.17,0:10:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,朝陽起 湖面平靜泛波光
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.96,0:10:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,執槳行舟亦無痕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.55,0:10:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,奧義 幽靜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.73,0:10:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是你的奧義?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.90,0:10:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,憑這也想殺我?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.11,0:11:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你就去地府見證我們成就大義吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,賤命神所賜…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.25,0:11:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他的奧義能干擾對方的精神
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,為誰欲長存
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.63,0:11:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,為了大義 都給我死
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.97,0:11:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,奧義 天命
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.11,0:11:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我覺得和你們的聯絡濃於血
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.57,0:11:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,一起賭上性命 完成使命
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.70,0:11:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我們起誓過的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.91,0:11:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,一起賭上性命
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺有點不可思議
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我只知道忍者的活法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.42,0:11:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但我即將成為父親
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.92,0:11:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我能做好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.97,0:12:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一起成為 這個孩子的父母吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.60,0:12:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.59,0:12:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,為甚麼不來救我們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.22,0:12:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.68,0:12:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:13:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠 蓮 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.99,0:13:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我們所作所為皆為世人 卻屢遭背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,最終迷失前路
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.66,0:13:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但忍者會改變
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.38,0:13:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不會讓你阻止我們走上前往未來的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.17,0:13:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,甚麼是未來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道 但感覺總有一天我會明白
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.68,0:13:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那或許就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.77,0:13:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你就留在這更加殘酷的景色裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.94,0:13:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,這次一定確保殺了你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,永別了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你果然內心深處仍然渴求友人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,為何拒絕和平?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不惜至此也要鬥爭嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.92,0:14:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只靠忍者的力量 無法造就和平
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那就展示你的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.76,0:14:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.41,0:15:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你既無法堅守忍者之道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.91,0:15:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,又沒有顛覆大義的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,怎能理解我的刃下之心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.25,0:15:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你這等貨色 也妄圖擊敗我?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.30,0:15:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,用你的雙眼 好好見證我們的力量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.41,0:15:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我的願望沒法實現
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,屆時整個世界都將陷入絕望
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.55,0:16:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.68,0:16:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像只能走到這裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.73,0:16:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,可你的心 仍然活著呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.90,0:16:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,即便充滿了憎恨和怒火
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.32,0:16:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,即便沉淪於絕望和悲傷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.07,0:16:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,人心也是易碎的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.95,0:16:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,可你不是已經 跨越這些了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.33,0:16:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,這是我心中的忍者奧秘
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.25,0:16:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,冷冽如火 熾熱如冰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.75,0:16:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,如此磨鍊心境
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.90,0:17:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,這件裝備會回應使用者的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,冷冽如火 熾熱如冰 如此磨鍊心境
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.57,0:17:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,這將成為你的刀刃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,雷公驅雲散
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.75,0:17:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼會…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的奧義…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,今日不敢鳴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,奧義本該是每人只能學一招的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.30,0:17:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,奧義 迅雷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.71,0:18:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,這才是 真正的忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.69,0:19:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,還有…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,繼承我意志的… 忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.95,0:19:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,即便我死了 也會成就大義吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.60,0:19:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,記好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.81,0:19:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,把世界的和平交給他人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是不會讓和平實現的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.16,0:20:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你也同樣 奪走了他人的和平
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.87,0:20:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,對我來說 只有這一點才是事實
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.81,0:20:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 磕到我頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.49,0:20:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你儘管出獄 每出來一次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我就讓你臉上開花一次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.38,0:20:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,臭小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.46,0:21:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 被佔領的各個政府機關就在剛才被解放了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎 到底怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.97,0:21:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可具體情況不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.85,0:21:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,烤鴨那傢伙 得手了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.92,0:21:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.42,0:21:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,放手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.67,0:21:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我身為忍者 卻對首領動手了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.21,0:21:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,忍者已經終結了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.61,0:22:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我想明白了 是人們交織的信念讓我得以活下來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.24,0:22:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你也應該一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.24,0:22:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,活著的人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.91,0:22:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,應該探求回報那些信念的路
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.79,0:22:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,繼續前行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.51,0:22:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我的身前 也有那樣一條路在等著我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.48,0:22:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,容身之處不止一個
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.70,0:22:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那條路上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.74,0:22:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一定有不同的景色
Comment: 0,0:00:-03.-65,0:00:-03.-65,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs55}註：出自萬葉集 卷十一 2416
Comment: 0,0:00:-03.-65,0:00:-03.-65,Default,,0,0,0,,Screen
Comment: 0,0:17:07.28,0:17:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.28,0:17:12.62,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Rain rain come wash away the pain
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:16.04,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}With demons in my head
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.04,0:17:21.67,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Vengeance is the only way
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.09,0:17:35.47,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}We had love before the end
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:38.31,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}We had trust, belief and friendship
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.31,0:17:40.14,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Maybe something more
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.14,0:17:43.06,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,720)\blur2\fax-0.1}Maybe something less
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.06,0:17:46.86,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}This is how I make amends
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.86,0:17:49.78,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}For the light I turn to darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.78,0:17:53.45,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Shedding blood until it’s done
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.45,0:18:01.37,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Rain rain come wash away this god damn pain
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.37,0:18:06.34,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Now vengeance is the only way
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:09.30,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}I’ll make you beg
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:12.76,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Make you pray
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.01,0:18:14.18,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Until your heart stops
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:15.39,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Until your heart stops
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.39,0:18:18.14,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}You’ll be wishing you were dead
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.39,0:18:21.23,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Because an eye or a tooth
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.23,0:18:23.39,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Won’t be all that you lose
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.39,0:18:29.44,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}I’ll make you pay for what you did
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:36.37,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}For what you did
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.62,0:18:42.91,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}There’s no other way
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.50,0:18:46.04,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}To end this pain and sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.42,0:18:48.84,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Take me to that place
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:51.71,ED_EN_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}Take me to tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.28,0:17:12.62,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}雨 雨沖洗掉這痛苦
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.62,0:17:16.04,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}被惡魔支配一般
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.04,0:17:21.67,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}只有選擇復仇
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.09,0:17:35.47,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}結束之前我們曾擁有愛
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.47,0:17:38.31,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}曾擁有信任 擁有信仰與友情
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.31,0:17:40.14,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}或許在此之上
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.14,0:17:43.06,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,720)\blur2\fax-0.1}或許在此之下
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.06,0:17:46.86,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}這就是我的改過
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.86,0:17:49.78,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}追尋光明我投向黑暗
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.78,0:17:53.45,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}浴血戰鬥至最後一刻
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.45,0:18:01.37,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}雨 雨沖洗掉這該死的痛苦
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.37,0:18:06.34,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}現在只有選擇復仇
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.34,0:18:09.30,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}我會讓你乞求
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.59,0:18:12.76,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}讓你祈禱
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.01,0:18:14.18,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}直至心臟停止
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.18,0:18:15.39,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}直至心臟停止
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.39,0:18:18.14,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}你將會求死不得
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.39,0:18:21.23,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}因為以牙還牙
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.23,0:18:23.39,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}不過只是開始而已
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.39,0:18:29.44,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}終究會讓你血債血償
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.15,0:18:36.37,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}付出代價
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.62,0:18:42.91,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}我別無選擇
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.50,0:18:46.04,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}為了告別這痛苦與悲傷
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.42,0:18:48.84,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}帶我去那邊
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.17,0:18:51.71,ED_CH_EP13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fax-0.1}帶我去明天
Comment: 0,0:00:-03.-65,0:00:-03.-65,Default,,0,0,0,,
